#: src/Abilities/Abilities/FilterSubscriptions.php:67
msgid "The rule tree to filter by. A single condition is { \"type\":\"condition\", \"attribute_name\":<key from filter schema>, \"operator_label\":<one of the attribute operators>, \"comparison_value\":<string value> }. A group is { \"type\":\"group\", \"combinator\":\"and\"|\"or\", \"conditions\":[ <condition or nested group>, ... ] }. Groups may be nested. Call get-subscriptions-filter-schema to discover valid attribute_name, operator_label, and supported_values."
msgstr "L’arbre de règles à utiliser pour le filtrage. Une condition simple est { \"type\":\"condition\", \"attribute_name\":<key from filter schema>, \"operator_label\":<one of the attribute operators>, \"comparison_value\":<string value> }. Un groupe est { \"type\":\"group\", \"combinator\":\"and\"|\"or\", \"conditions\":[ <condition or nested group>, ... ] }. Les groupes peuvent être imbriqués. Appelez get-subscriptions-filter-schema pour découvrir les valeurs valides de attribute_name, operator_label et supported_values."

#: src/Abilities/Abilities/FilterSubscriptions.php:30
msgid "Retrieve a paginated list of subscriptions matching a rule tree. Supports single conditions and nested and/or groups across any filterable attribute. Call get-subscriptions-filter-schema first to discover valid attribute_name, operator_label, and supported_values."
msgstr "Récupérer une liste paginée des abonnements correspondant à un arbre de règles. Prend en charge les conditions simples et les groupes et/ou imbriqués sur n’importe quel attribut filtrable. Appelez d’abord get-subscriptions-filter-schema pour découvrir les valeurs valides de attribute_name, operator_label et supported_values."

